# No AI attribution tags

Do not add AI product attribution to commits, pull request bodies, or file headers.

Forbidden:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor` and any Cursor co-author trailer
- `Made-with: Cursor` and `cursor.com/open` footers
- Generated-with / Made-with badges for Claude, Codex, Antigravity, or Copilot
- Robot generator footers

This does not ban naming Cursor as the SAD materialization platform, or CSS `cursor` properties.

Commits and PRs in this repository must read as ordinary human git history.
